 done, you sick bastard!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"initr":2,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_193_frostl_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Frostleaf","text":"You can't escape."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1507_Mephisto_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Mephisto","text":"Little fox, you're getting a bit too close for comfort."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_193_frostl_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Frostleaf","text":"Because I am the one who will take your life."},{"t":"line","name":"Frostleaf","text":"Those who do not respect the sanctity of life..."},{"t":"line","name":"Frostleaf","text":"Do not deserve on of their own."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1507_Mephisto_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Mephisto","text":"Hehhh..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1507_Mephisto_1"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"screenadapt":"coverall","image":"bg_cher_6","width":1,"height":1,"fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Mephisto","text":"Is that so."},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.5,"xstrength":10,"ystrength":10,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.5,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":3,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_surfacefrozen","volume":0.8}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_193_frostl_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Frostleaf","text":"?!"},{"t":"line","name":"Frostleaf","text":"What... My feet...?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_219_meteo_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Meteorite","text":"Amiya! Reunion forces are appearing from all directions! Even though there aren't a lot of them..."},{"t":"line","name":"Meteorite","text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"chara